cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software (the platform code, not the src/data/ directory
  contents — see the "License" section of README.md for why those are
  governed separately), please cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  ICH Research DataBoard: a browser-only governance toolkit for
  intangible cultural heritage AI datasets
type: software
abstract: >-
  A browser-only governance toolkit for intangible cultural heritage (ICH)
  AI datasets: a rights gate that admits a dataset to training, evaluation
  or generation only when authentic rights files and the recorded
  permissions allow it, an evidence registry that separates reviewed
  records from re-hashable files, a split-leakage validator, and a
  client-side SHA-256 audit hash-chain. The case data comes from Jiangxi
  ramie-cloth (xiabu) heritage. No build tools or server required — open
  src/index.html directly.
